{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8843c05d-3755-814d-9b7f-23aecb6a66e9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:16:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Rosemarie Lombardozzi. So, I grew up down by the harbor, right, and when I was a kid my father used to say the water always finds its way back to where it started. Well, it's found its way to my corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Where's the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 93 Mill Street, up on the Hill. The storm drain right on the corner is full to the top. Not draining at all. It's been like that since that nor'easter ended Saturday, and that's three days ago now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three days, and it's still sitting full?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still full. Brown water right up to the grate, just sitting there. And the cars are slowing to a crawl going through it, because it spreads out into the road. People are swerving around it. Somebody's going to get hit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I hear you. Has anything been done out there that you've seen? Any truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:14:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody. That's what I want to know, when did they last come by? Because I haven't seen a truck on this corner in I don't know how long. Does anybody even clean that drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see the cleaning dates from this screen, I'll be honest. What I can do is put in a work order for a crew to check that catch basin and I'll note that it's backed up and affecting traffic. Is it Mill Street at the corner of what, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:15:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] It's right at my corner, the one by my front walk. It's the low spot, the whole street runs down to it. Sorry, I'm on my cell, I'm standing out here looking at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:15:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I've got 93 Mill Street, Historic Hill, drain on the corner full and not draining, traffic slowing through the water. Is the water coming up on anyone's property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:15:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, it's stopping at the curb. But the next rain, forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:15:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Crews have been slammed since the storm, but I'll flag this one so it's not just sitting in the pile. And I'll ask someone to get back to you about the last service date. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:16:07-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0186. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Well, I'm sorry, I'm distracted, I'm making a list of baby names for my friend, and I've been out here staring at this drain instead of finishing it. Please just get somebody out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do, Rosemarie. Hope the list goes better than the drain. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Denise. Bye."
    }
  ],
